  "status": "partial",
  "summary": "MSUI has a real SoundEntries.dbc-driven audio path (weighted variant selection with no-immediate-repeat, per-entry volume/distance policy, loops and holds, off-thread MCI playback) covering spell kit sounds, missile audio, and a broad set of UI panel cues routed through PlayUiSound. Everything else in Benilla's sound surface - the ambient world soundscape and all server-driven sound opcodes - is absent.",
  "openItems": [
    {
      "id": "item-triage-0dfa4962",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No zone music or zone/interior ambience (Benilla sound/zone.rs, interior.rs): entering a zone plays nothing; no music/ambience category volumes (Sound Options button is disabled with 'There is no sound subsystem yet' - Program.Settings.cs:636), so the reference CVar defaults (music 0.4, ambience 0.6) have no counterpart.",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-fddc5856",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No footstep audio (sound/footsteps.rs) for self or observed units.",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-1b82246b",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No weather audio and no SMSG_WEATHER handling at all (sound/weather.rs; opcode absent from Program.Net.cs dispatch).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-e3bbeb23",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No melee combat impact sounds and no creature vocalizations - aggro/wound/death cries (sound/combat.rs, creature.rs, anim_events.rs).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-6ad823bd",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No emote sounds and no CMSG/SMSG_TEXT_EMOTE sound path (sound/emote.rs; SMSG_TEXT_EMOTE is declared in Opcodes.cs but never dispatched).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-98ea4353",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No money/coin sounds on loot or coinage change (sound/money.rs) and no item-push pickup cue (SMSG_ITEM_PUSH_RESULT is handled for bags/loot but plays nothing).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-f04a43c0",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No mount/dismount audio (sound/mount.rs) and no sheathe/unsheathe weapon sounds (sound/sheathe.rs - MSUI tracks sheath state on the wire but plays no cue).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-09a45dd5",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No water/liquid loops, underwater muffling, or interior reverb (sound/liquid_loop.rs, water.rs, reverb.rs).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-a7416798",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No GameObject sound emitters (sound/gameobject.rs) and no NPC greeting/farewell voice lines on interaction open/close (sound/greeting.rs).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-4218e97b",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No glue-screen (login/character-select) music or UI sounds outside the world session (sound/glue.rs).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-7ea9641d",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "No exploration fanfare - SMSG_EXPLORATION_EXPERIENCE unhandled (sound/zone.rs ExplorationSounds).",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-d74d62d6",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "Server-scripted SMSG_PLAY_SOUND and SMSG_PLAY_MUSIC are not handled - scripted world moments stay silent.",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-88c76a39",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "Backend is Windows-only MCI; other platforms are observable-but-silent by design (Benilla's mixer plays everywhere a device exists). Listener model is a raw position handed per Play call, not the reference listener-at-character pose/orientation law with pan.",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-3.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    }
  ],
